#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kstars;"
msgstr "Konfigurisanje &kstars;"

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Geographic Location"
msgstr "Postavljanje geografskog položaja"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a screenshot of the <guilabel>Set Geographic Location</guilabel> "
"window:"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je slika ekrana <guilabel>Postavi geografsku lokaciju</guilabel> "
"prozora:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the Geographic Location"
msgstr "Mijenjanje geografske lokacije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set Location Window"
msgstr "Postavi prozor lokacije"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a list of over 2500 predefined cities available to choose from. You "
"set your location by highlighting a city from this list. Each city is "
"represented in the world map as a small dot, and when a city is highlighted "
"in the list, a red crosshairs appears on its location in the map."
msgstr ""
"Postoji popis preko 2500 predefiniranih gradova koji su na raspolaganju za "
"odabir. Vi postavljate vašu lokaciju isticanjem grada iz ove liste. Svaki "
"grad je zastupljen u karti svijeta kao mala tačka, a kada je istaknut grad "
"na listi, a crveni križ se pojavljuje na lokaciji u mapi."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:32 config.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Geographic Location Tool"
msgstr "Alat za geografski položaj"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "Filtriranje"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is not practical to scroll through the full list of 2500 locations, "
"looking for a specific city. To make searches easier, the list can be "
"filtered by entering text in the boxes below the map. For example, in the "
"screenshot, the text <quote>Ba</quote> appears in the <guilabel>City Filter</"
"guilabel> box, while <quote>M</quote> has been entered in the "
"<guilabel>Province Filter</guilabel> box, and <quote>USA</quote> is in the "
"<guilabel>Country Filter</guilabel> box. Note that all of the cities "
"displayed in the list have city, province, and country names that begin with "
"the entered filter strings, and that the message below the filter boxes "
"indicates that 7 cities are matched by the filters. Also notice that the "
"dots representing these seven cities in the map have been colored white, "
"while the unmatched cities remain gray."
msgstr ""
"Nije praktično za kretanje kroz kompletan spisak od 2500 lokacija, u potrazi "
"za određenim gradom. Da bi olakšali pretragu, lista može biti filtrirana "
"unosom teksta u kutije ispod karte. Na primjer, na slici ekrana, "
"tekst<quote>Ba</quote> se pojavljuje u <guilabel>Filter gradova</guilabel> "
"kutiji, dok <quote>M</quote> se pojavilo u  <guilabel>Filter pokrajina</"
"guilabel> kutiji, i <quote>USA</quote>se u <guilabel>Filter država</"
"guilabel> kutiji. Imajte na umu da svi gradovi prikazani u listi imaju imena "
"grada, pokrajina i zemlje koje počinju sa unesenom filter riječi, a poruka "
"ispod filter kutije ukazuje na to da 7 gradova, pronađeni su od strane "
"filtera. Također primijetiti da tačkice koje predstavljaju ovih sedam "
"gradova na karti su bijele boje,  dok ostalim gradovima ostaje siva."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list can also be filtered by location in the map. Clicking anywhere in "
"the world map will show only those cities within two degrees of the clicked "
"location. At this time, you can search by name, or by location, but not both "
"at once. In other words, when you click on the map, the name filters are "
"ignored, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Lista se također može filtrirati po lokaciji na karti. Klikom bilo gdje u "
"svijetu karti će pokazati samo one gradove u okviru od dva stepena od klik "
"lokacije. U ovom trenutku, možete pretraživati po imenu, ili po lokaciji, "
"ali ne oba odjednom. Drugim riječima, kada kliknete na kartu, imena unutar "
"filtera se zanemaruju, i obrnuto."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom locations"
msgstr "Prilagodi lokacije"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"ai-geocoords\">longitude, latitude</link> and <link "
"linkend=\"ai-timezones\">time zone</link> information for the currently-"
"selected location are displayed in the boxes at the bottom of the window. If "
"you feel that any of these values are inaccurate, you can modify them and "
"press the <guibutton>Add City to List</guibutton> button to record your "
"custom version of the location. You can also define a completely new "
"location by pressing the <guibutton>Clear Fields</guibutton> button, and "
"entering the data for the new location. Note that all fields except the "
"optional <guilabel>State/Province</guilabel> must be filled before the new "
"location can be added to the list. &kstars; will automatically load your "
"custom locations for all future sessions. Please note, at this point, the "
"only way to remove a custom location is to remove the appropriate line from "
"the file <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kstars/mycities.dat</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"ai-geocoords\">dužina, širina</link> i <link linkend=\"ai-"
"timezones\">vremenska zona</link>informacija za trenutno odabranom lokacijom "
"se prikazuju u kutijama na dnu prozora. Ako mislite da bilo koje od ovih "
"vrijednosti su netačne, možete ih mijenjati i pritisnite <guibutton>Dodaj "
"grad na listu</guibutton> dugme za snimanje prilagođene verzije lokacije. "
"Također možete definirati potpuno novu lokaciju pritiskom <guibutton>Očisti "
"polja</guibutton>dugme, za unos podataka za novu lokaciju. Imajte na umu da "
"sva polja osim opcionalnih<guilabel>Država/Pokrajina</guilabel> mora biti "
"ispunjen prije što nova lokacija može biti dodana na listu. &kstars; će "
"automatski učitati prilagođenu lokaciju za sve buduće sjednice. Imajte na "
"umu, u ovom trenutku, jedini način da se ukloni prilagođena lokacija je da "
"se uklone odgovarajuće linije iz datoteke<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kstars/"
"mycities.dat</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you add custom locations (or modify existing ones), please send us your "
"<filename>mycities.dat</filename> file so that we can add your locations to "
"the master list."
msgstr ""
"Ako dodate prilagođenu lokaciju (ili modifikujete postojeće), molimo vas da "
"nam pošaljete svoju <filename>mycities.dat</filename> datoteku tako da "
"možemo dodati vaše lokacije na master listu."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Time"
msgstr "Podešavanje vremena"

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:81 config.docbook:96 config.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Date and Time"
msgstr "Datum i vrijeme"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "The simulation clock"
msgstr "Simulacioni sat"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &kstars; starts up, the time is set to your computer's system clock, "
"and the &kstars; clock is running to keep up with the real time. If you want "
"to stop the clock, select <guimenuitem>Stop Clock</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Time</guimenu> menu, or simply click on the <guiicon>Stop Clock</"
"guiicon> icon in the toolbar. You can make the clock run slower or faster "
"than normal, or even make it run backward, using the time-step spinbox in "
"the toolbar. This spinbox has two sets of up/down buttons. The first one "
"will step through all 83 available time steps, one by one. The second one "
"will skip to the next higher (or lower) unit of time, which allows you to "
"make large timestep changes more quickly."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &kstars; pokreće, vrijeme je postavljeno na sistemski sat vašeg "
"računara, i &kstars; sat se kreće kako bi ostao u toku sa stvarnim vremenom. "
"Ako želite da se zaustavi sat, odaberite <guimenuitem>Zaustavi sat</"
"guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Vrijeme</guimenu>izbornika, ili jednostavno "
"kliknite na <guiicon>Zaustavi sat</guiicon>ikonu i traci alata. Možete "
"napraviti sat sporijim ili bržim nego inače, ili čak učinit da otkucava "
"unazad, koristeći vremenski korak spinbox na alatnoj traci. Ovaj spinbox ima "
"dva seta gore/dolje tipki. Prvi korak će proći kroz svih  83 koraka "
"raspoloživog vrijemena, jedan po jedan. Drugi će preskočiti na sljedeću višu "
"(ili manju) jedinicu vremena, koji vam omogućava da činite velike vremenske "
"korake brže."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Podešavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set the time and date by selecting <guimenuitem>Set Time...</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Time</guimenu> menu, or by pressing the "
"<guiicon>time</guiicon> icon in the toolbar. The <guilabel>Set Time</"
"guilabel> window uses a standard &kde; Date Picker widget, coupled with two "
"spinboxes for setting the hours and minutes. If you want to re-synchronize "
"the simulation clock back to the current CPU time, just select "
"<guimenuitem>Set Time to Now</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Time</guimenu> "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete postaviti vrijeme i datum selektovanjem <guimenuitem>Postavi "
"vrijeme...</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Vrijeme</guimenu> izbornika, ili "
"pritiskom na <guiicon>vrijeme</guiicon> ikonu u traci alata.  "
"<guilabel>Postavi vrijeme</guilabel> prozor koji koristi standard &kde; Alat "
"za odabir datuma, u kombinaciji sa dva spinboksa za postavljanje sata i "
"minuta. Ako želite da ponovo sinhronizujete simulirani sat natrag u trenutno "
"CPU vrijeme, samo odaberite <guimenuitem>Postavi vrijeme na sad</"
"guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Vrijeme</guimenu> izbornika."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extended range of dates"
msgstr "Prošireni raspon datuma"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; can accept very remote dates beyond the usual limits imposed by "
"QDate. Currently, you can set the date between the years -50000 and +50000. "
"We may extend this range even further in future releases. However, please be "
"aware that the accuracy of the simulation becomes more and more degraded as "
"more remote dates are examined. This is especially true for the positions of "
"solar system bodies."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; može prihvatiti vrlo udaljene datume izvan uobičajenih ograničenja "
"koje nameće QDate. Trenutno, možete postaviti datum između godina i -50.000 "
"i 50.000.Možda produžimo ovaj opseg čak i dalje u budućim izdanjima. Ipak, "
"imajte na umu da je tačnost simulacije postaje sve više i više degradirana "
"što se udaljeniji datumi ispituju. To se posebno odnosi na pozicije tijela "
"solarnih sistema."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Configure &kstars; Window"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &kstars; Prozor"

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:122 config.docbook:152 config.docbook:168 config.docbook:182
#: config.docbook:194 config.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure &kstars; window"
msgstr "Konfiguriši &kstars; prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Configure &kstars;</guilabel> window allows you to modify a "
"wide range of display options. You can access the window with the "
"<guiicon>configure</guiicon> toolbar icon, or by selecting "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kstars;...</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> menu. The window is depicted below:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Konfiguriši &kstars;</guilabel>prozor vam omogućuju da promijenite "
"širok spektar opcija prikaza. Možete pristupiti prozoru sa "
"<guiicon>konfiguriši</guiicon>ikoni na traci alata, ili selektovanjem "
"<guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kstars;...</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> izbornika. Prozor je predstavljen ispod:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Configure &kstars; Window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Konfiguriši &kstars; Prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Configure &kstars; Window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Konfiguriši &kstars; Prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Configure &kstars;</guilabel> window is divided into nine "
"pages: <guilabel>Catalogs</guilabel>, <guilabel>Solar System</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Satellites</guilabel>, <guilabel>Supernovae</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Guides</guilabel>, <guilabel>Colors</guilabel>, <guilabel>INDI</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Xplanet</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Konfiguriši &kstars;</guilabel> prozor je podijeljen u devet "
"stranica: <guilabel>Katalozi</guilabel>, <guilabel>Solarni sistem</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Sateliti</guilabel>, <guilabel>Supernova</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Uputstva</guilabel>, <guilabel>Boje</guilabel>, <guilabel>INDI</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Xplaneta</guilabel>, i <guilabel>Napredno</guilabel>."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Catalogs page"
msgstr "Stranica kataloga"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Catalogs</guilabel> page, you determine which object "
"catalogs are displayed in the map. The <guilabel>Stars</guilabel> section "
"also allows you to set the <quote>faint <link linkend=\"ai-magnitude"
"\">magnitude</link> limit</quote> for stars, and the <link linkend=\"ai-"
"magnitude\">magnitude</link> limit for displaying the names and/or "
"magnitudes of stars. Below the stars section, the <guilabel>Deep-Sky "
"Objects</guilabel> section controls the display of several non-stellar "
"object catalogs. By default, the list includes the Messier, NGC and IC "
"catalogs. You can add your own custom object catalogs by pressing the "
"<guibutton>Import Catalog</guibutton> or <guilabel>Load Catalog</guilabel> "
"button. For detailed instructions on preparing a catalog data file, see the "
"<filename>README.customize</filename> file that ships with &kstars;."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel>Katalozima </guilabel> stranici, vi određujete koji katalozi "
"objekta se prikazuju u mapi. <guilabel>Zvijezde </guilabel> odjeljak vam "
"dopušta da postavite <quote>faint <link linkend=\"ai-magnitude\">veličine </"
"link> limit</quote> za zvijezde, i za <link linkend=\"ai-magnitude"
"\">veličinu</link> limit za prikazivanje imena i/ili veličine zvijezda.Ispod "
"odijeljka zvijezda, <guilabel>Duboki-Nebeski objekti</guilabel> odjeljku "
"kontrolira prikaz nekoliko ne-zvjezdanih kataloga objekta. Podrazumijevano, "
"lista uključuje Messier, NGC i IC kataloge. Možete dodati svoje vlastite "
"prilagođene objekte kataloga pritiskom na<guibutton>Uvoz kataloga</"
"guibutton> ili <guilabel>Učitaj katalog</guilabel> dugme. Za detaljnije "
"instrukcije ili pripremu za datoteku podataka kataloga<filename>PROČITAJME."
"prilagodi</filename>datoteku koja se isporučuje sa &kstars;."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Solar System page"
msgstr "Stranica solarnog sistema"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Solar System</guilabel> page, you can specify whether the "
"Sun, Moon, planets, comets and asteroids are displayed, and whether the "
"major bodies are drawn as colored circles or actual images. You can also "
"toggle whether solar system bodies have name labels attached, and control "
"how many of the comets and asteroids get name labels. There is an option to "
"automatically attach a temporary <quote>orbit trail</quote> whenever a solar "
"system body is tracked, and another to toggle whether the color of the orbit "
"trail fades into the background sky color."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel>Solarni sistem</guilabel> stranici, možete odrediti da li su "
"Sunce, Mjesec, planeta, kometa ili asteroidi prikazani, i da li su glavna "
"tijela nacrtana kao obojeni krugovi ili stvarne slike. Također možete "
"prebaciti koja tijela Sunčevog sistem imaju ime prikačeno u prilogu, i "
"kontrolisati koliko je kometa i asteroida dobilo ime etikete. Postoji "
"mogućnost da se automatski priloži privremena <quote>staza orbite</quote> "
"kad god se prati  tijelo solarnog sistema, a drugi da biste se kretali kada "
"boja  staze orbite nestaje u pozadini boje neba."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Guides page"
msgstr "Stranica uputstava"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Guides</guilabel> page lets you toggle whether non-objects are "
"displayed (&ie;, constellation lines, constellation names, the Milky Way "
"contour, the <link linkend=\"ai-cequator\">celestial equator</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"ai-ecliptic\">the ecliptic</link>, <link linkend=\"ai-horizon"
"\">the horizon line</link>, and the opaque ground). You can also choose "
"whether you would like to see Latin constellation names, <acronym>IAU</"
"acronym>-standard three-letter abbreviations, or constellation names using "
"your local language."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uputstva</guilabel> stranica vam omogućava da nasumični ne-objekti "
"su prikazani (&ie;,  linije konstelacije, imena konstelacija,  kontura "
"Mliječnog puta, u <link linkend=\"ai-cequator\">nebeski ekvator</link>, "
"<link linkend=\"ai-ecliptic\">ekliptika</link>, <link linkend=\"ai-horizon"
"\">horizontalna linija</link>, i neprozirna zemlja). Također možete odabrati "
"da li biste željeli vidjeti Latinska imena konstelacije, <acronym>IAU</"
"acronym>-standardne troslovne skraćenice, ili konstelacija imena koristeći "
"vaš jezik."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors page"
msgstr "Stranica boja"

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:196 config.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color Schemes"
msgstr "Šeme boja"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:197 config.docbook:304 config.docbook:311 config.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing"
msgstr "Prilagodi"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> page allows you to set the color scheme, and "
"to define custom color schemes. The tab is split into two panels:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Boje</guilabel> stranica vam omogućava da postavite boju šeme, i "
"da se definiraju prilagođene boje šema. Kartica je podijeljena u dva panela:"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left panel shows a list of all display items with adjustable colors. "
"Click on any item to bring up a color selection window to adjust its color. "
"Below the list is the <guilabel>Star Color Mode</guilabel> selection box. By "
"default, &kstars; draws stars with a <link linkend=\"ai-colorandtemp"
"\">realistic color</link> tint according to the spectral type of the star. "
"However, you may also choose to draw the stars as solid white, black or red "
"circles. If you are using the realistic star colors, you can set the "
"saturation level of the star colors with the <guilabel>Star Color Intensity</"
"guilabel> spinbox."
msgstr ""
"Lijevi panel prikazuje listu prikaza svih stavki s podesivim bojama. "
"Kliknite na bilo koju stavku da bi se pojavio prozor izbora boja da "
"prilagodite svoje boje. Ispod liste je<guilabel>Režim zvjezdane boje</"
"guilabel> odabir kutije. Podrazumijevani, &kstars; crta zvijezde sa <link "
"linkend=\"ai-colorandtemp\">realističnim bojama</link> tintu prema "
"spektralnom tipu zvijezde. Međutim, možete odabrati da crtate zvijezde kao "
"čvrste bijele, crne ili crvene krugovime. Ako koristite realne boje "
"zvijezda, možete podesiti zasićenje nivoa boje sa zvezdom <guilabel>Jačina "
"boja zvijezde</guilabel> u kutiji odabira."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The right panel lists the defined color schemes. There are four predefined "
"schemes: the <guilabel>Default Colors</guilabel> scheme, <guilabel>Star "
"Chart</guilabel>, which uses black stars on a white background, "
"<guilabel>Night Vision</guilabel>, which uses only shades of red in order to "
"protect dark-adapted vision, and <guilabel>Moonless Night</guilabel>, a more "
"realistic, dark theme. Additionally, you can save the current color settings "
"as a custom scheme by clicking the <guibutton>Save Current Colors</"
"guibutton> button. It will prompt you for a name for the new scheme, and "
"then your scheme will appear in the list in all future &kstars; sessions. To "
"remove a custom scheme, simply highlight it in the list, and press the "
"<guibutton>Remove Color Scheme</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Desni panel navodi šemu definiranih boja. Postoje četiri predefinirane šeme: "
"je <guilabel>Podrazumijevane boje</guilabel> šema, <guilabel>Grafik "
"zvijezda</guilabel>, koji koristi crne zvijezde na bijeloj pozadini, "
"<guilabel>Noćni pogled</guilabel>, koji koristi samo nijanse crvene u cilju "
"zaštite tamno-prilagođene vizije, i <guilabel>Noći bez mjesečine</guilabel>, "
"realniju, tamnu temu. Osim toga, možete sačuvati trenutne postavke boje kao "
"prilagođenu šema klikom na <guibutton>Spasi trenutne boje</guibutton> dugme. "
"Pitat će vas za ime nove šeme, a zatim vaša šema će se pojaviti na listi u "
"svim budućim &kstars; sesijama. Da uklonite prilagođenu šemu, jednostavno "
"označite je u listi, zatim kliknite na <guibutton>Ukloni šemu boja</"
"guibutton>dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For detailed explanation of the options on the <guilabel>INDI</guilabel> "
"page see the <link linkend=\"indi-configure\">Configure INDI</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Za detaljnije objašnjenje opcija na <guilabel>INDI</guilabel> stranici "
"vidite  <link linkend=\"indi-configure\">Konfiguriši INDI</link> sekciju."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced page"
msgstr "Napredna stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> page provides fine-grained control over "
"the more subtle behaviors of &kstars;."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Napredna</guilabel>stranica omogućava granuliziranu kontronu nad "
"suptilnijim ponašanjima &kstars;."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Atmospheric Refraction"
msgstr "Atmosferska refrakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Correct for atmospheric refraction</guilabel> checkbox "
"controls whether the positions of objects are corrected for the effects of "
"the atmosphere. Because the atmosphere is a spherical shell, light from "
"outer space is <quote>bent</quote> as it passes through the atmosphere to "
"our telescopes or eyes on the Earth's surface. The effect is largest for "
"objects near the horizon, and actually changes the predicted rise or set "
"times of objects by a few minutes. In fact, when you <quote>see</quote> a "
"sunset, the Sun's actual position is already well below the horizon; "
"atmospheric refraction makes it seem as if the Sun is still in the sky. Note "
"that atmospheric refraction is never applied if you are using "
"<guilabel>Equatorial coordinates</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ispravka za atmosfersku refrakciju</guilabel> potvrda kontroliše "
"da li su pozicije objekata ispravljene za efekte atmosfere. Budući da je "
"atmosfera sferna ljuska, svjetlost iz svemira je <quote>savijena</quote> dok "
"prolazi kroz atmosferu ka našim teleskopima ili očima na površini Zemlje. "
"Efekat je najveći za objekte u blizini horizonta, i zapravo mijenja "
"predviđeni porast ili postavljanje vremena objekta za nekoliko minuta. U "
"stvari, kada <quote>vidite</quote> zalazak sunca, Sunčev stvarni položaj je "
"već ispod horizonta; atmosferske refrakcije čini da izgleda kao da je Sunce "
"i dalje na nebu. Imajte na umu da atmosferske refrakcije se nikad ne "
"primjenjuje ako koristite <guilabel>Ekvatorijalne koordinate</guilabel>."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Animated Slewing"
msgstr "Animirano okretanje"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Use animating slewing</guilabel> checkbox controls how the "
"display changes when a new focus position is selected in the map. By "
"default, you will see the sky drift or <quote>slew</quote> to the new "
"position; if you uncheck this option, then the display will instead "
"<quote>snap</quote> immediately to the new focus position."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristite animirano okretanje</guilabel>potvrdu  kako se ekrana "
"mijenja kada je izabran novi položaj fokusa na karti. Podrzumijevano, vidjet "
"ćete  pomak neba ili <quote>mnoštvo</quote>na novi položaj; ako otčekirajte "
"ovu opciju, a zatim na ekranu će se umjesto <quote>slike</quote> prebaciti "
"odmah na novi položaj fokusa."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:260 config.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objects in the Sky"
msgstr "Objekti na nebu"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Labeling"
msgstr "Označavanje"

#. Tag: tertiary
#: config.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automatski"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Attach label to centered object</guilabel> checkbox is "
"selected, then a name label will automatically be attached to an object when "
"it is being tracked by the program. The label will be removed when the "
"object is no longer being tracked. Note that you can also manually attach a "
"persistent name label to any object with its <link linkend=\"popup-menu"
"\">popup menu</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ako   <guilabel> Pričvrstite oznaku na centrirani objekat</guilabel> potvrda "
"je označena, zatim ime labele će automatski biti priključeno na objekat kada "
"praćen od strane programa. Oznaka će biti uklonjena kada se više objekat ne "
"prati. Imajte na umu da možete i ručno postaviti dosljedno ime oznake na "
"bilo koji objekat sa svojim <link linkend=\"popup-menu\">iskačućim "
"izbornikom</link>."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hiding"
msgstr "Skrivanje"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are three situations when &kstars; must redraw the sky display very "
"rapidly: when a new focus position is selected (and <guilabel>Use animated "
"slewing</guilabel> is checked), when the sky is dragged with the mouse, and "
"when the time step is large. In these situations, the positions of all "
"objects must be recomputed as rapidly as possible, which can put a large "
"load on the <abbrev>CPU</abbrev>. If the <abbrev>CPU</abbrev> cannot keep up "
"with the demand, then the display will seem sluggish or jerky. To mitigate "
"this, &kstars; will hide certain objects during these rapid-redraw "
"situations, as long as the <guilabel>Hide objects while moving</guilabel> "
"checkbox is selected. The timestep threshold above which objects will be "
"hidden is determined by the <guilabel>Also hide if timescale greater than:</"
"guilabel> timestep-spinbox. You can specify the objects that should be "
"hidden in the <guilabel>Configure Hidden Objects</guilabel> group box."
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri situacije kada &kstars; mora vrlo brzo ponovno iscrtati prikaza "
"neba: kada je izabran novi položaj fokusa (i <guilabel>Koristi animirano "
"okretanje</guilabel>je označeno), kada je nebo odvučeno s mišem, a kada je "
"korak vremena velik. U tim situacijama, pozicije svih objekata moraju biti "
"reprogramirane što je brže moguće, što može staviti veliki teret na "
"<abbrev>CPU</abbrev>. Ako <abbrev>CPU</abbrev> ne mogu držati korak sa "
"komandom, ekran će izgledati tromo ili isprekidano. Da bi ublažili ovaj,"
"&kstars; će sakriti određene objekte tijekom ove brze-ponovnocrtanje "
"situacijama, sve dok se<guilabel>Sakrij objekte dok se kreću</guilabel> je "
"označeno. Prag koraka vremena iznad koje  će objekti biti skrivena je "
"određena <guilabel>Također sakriti ako je vremenski period veći od:</"
"guilabel> timestep-spinbox.Možete odrediti predmete koji bi trebali biti "
"skriveni u <guilabel>Konfiguriši skrivene objekte</guilabel> grupnoj kutiji."

#. Tag: title
#: config.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing the Display"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are several ways to modify the display to your liking."
msgstr "Postoji nekoliko načina da uredite ekran po svom ukusu."

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting"
msgstr "Odabir"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a different color scheme in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Color Schemes</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. There "
"are four predefined color schemes, and you can define your own in the <link "
"linkend=\"config\"><guilabel>Configure &kstars;</guilabel></link> window."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite različitu boju šeme u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Boja šema</guimenuitem></menuchoice> izborniku. Postoje "
"četiri predefinirane  boje šema, a možete definirati vlastite u <link "
"linkend=\"config\"><guilabel>Konfiguriši &kstars;</guilabel></link> prozoru."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "Alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Toggle whether the Toolbars are drawn in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Toolbars Shown</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. Like "
"most KDE toolbars, they can also be dragged around and anchored on any "
"window edge, or even detached from the window completely if they are "
"unlocked."
msgstr ""
"Prebacivanje i alatna traka se nalaze u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Prikaz alatnih trana</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"izborniku. Kao većina KDE alatnih traka, mogu se vući okolo i pozicionirati "
"na bilo koji rub prozora, ili čak odvojiti od prozora u potpunosti ako su "
"otključana."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:311 config.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Info Boxes"
msgstr "Kutije sa informacijama"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "Sjenčenje"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Toggle whether the Info Boxes are drawn in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Info Boxes</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. In addition, you can manipulate the three "
"Info Boxes with the mouse. Each box has additional lines of data that are "
"hidden by default. You can toggle whether these additional lines are visible "
"by double-clicking a box to <quote>shade</quote> it. Also, you can "
"reposition a box by dragging it with the mouse. When a box hits a window "
"edge, it will <quote>stick</quote> to the edge when the window is resized."
msgstr ""
"Prebacivanje info kutija je nacrtano u  <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Info kutije</guimenuitem></menuchoice> izborniku.Osim "
"toga, možete manipulirati  tri  Infok utije s mišem. Svaka kutija ima "
"dodatne linije podataka koji su, podrazumijevano, skriveni. Možete ih "
"prebacivati kada su ove dodatne linije vidljivi dvostrukim klikom "
"<quote>sjenčiti</quote>ih . Također, možete premještati kutije sa "
"povlačenjem miša. Kada kutiji udari rub prozor, on će<quote>se zalijepiti</"
"quote> za rub kada se mijenja veličina prozora."

#. Tag: primary
#: config.docbook:324 config.docbook:335 config.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid "Field-of-View Symbols"
msgstr "Vidno polje simbola"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose an <quote>FOV Symbol</quote> using the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>FOV Symbols</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. "
"<firstterm>FOV</firstterm> is an acronym for <quote>field-of-view</quote>. "
"An FOV symbol is drawn at the center of the window to indicate where the "
"display is pointing. Different symbols have different angular sizes; you can "
"use a symbol to show what the view through a particular telescope would look "
"like. For example, if you choose the <quote>7x35 Binoculars</quote> FOV "
"symbol, then a circle is drawn on the display that is 9.2 degrees in "
"diameter; this is the field-of-view for 7x35 binoculars."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite <quote>FOV Simbol</quote> koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>FOV Simboli</guimenuitem></menuchoice> izbornik. "
"<firstterm>FOV</firstterm>je akronim za <quote>polja pregleda</quote>. FOV "
"simbol je nacrtan u centru prozora da ukazuju gde ekran pokazuje. Različiti "
"simboli imaju različite veličine pravougaonika; možete koristiti određeni "
"simbol da prikažete kako bi izgledao određeni pogled kroz određeni teleskop."
"Na primjer, ako odaberete<quote>7x35 Dvogled</quote> FOV simbol, a zatim "
"krug je nacrtana na ekranu koji je 9.2 stepena u promjeru; ovo je pogled "
"polja 7x35 dvogled."

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can define your own FOV symbols (or modify the existing symbols) using "
"the <guimenuitem>Edit FOV Symbols...</guimenuitem> menu item, which launches "
"the FOV Editor:"
msgstr ""
"Možete definisati svoje FOV simbole (ili modifikovati već postojeće simbole)"
"koristeći <guimenuitem>Uredi FOV Simbole...</guimenuitem> stavku izbornika, "
"koja pokreće FOV Editor:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "Field-of-View Symbols Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač vidnog polja simbola"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "FOV Symbol Editor"
msgstr "FOV Uređivač simbola"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list of defined FOV symbols is displayed on the left. On the right are "
"buttons for adding a new symbol, editing the highlighted symbol's "
"properties, and removing the highlighted symbol from the list. Note that you "
"can even modify or remove the four predefined symbols (if you remove all "
"symbols, the four defaults will be restored the next time you start "
"&kstars;). Below these three buttons is a graphical preview display showing "
"the highlighted symbol from the list. When the <guibutton>New...</guibutton> "
"or <guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> button is pressed, the <guilabel>New FOV "
"Indicator</guilabel> window is opened:"
msgstr ""
"Lista definiranih FOV simbola je prikazana na lijevoj strani. Na desnoj "
"strani su tipke za dodavanje novog simbol, uređivanje označenih simbola, i "
"uklanjanje označenog simbola iz liste. Imajte na umu da čak možete mijenjati "
"ili ukloniti četiri predefinirana simbola (ako uklonite sve simbole, četiri "
"podrazumijevana će se vratiti sljedeći put kada pokrenete &kstars;). Ispod "
"ove tri tipke je grafički pregled ekrana koji pokazuje istaknuti simbol iz "
"liste. Kada  <guibutton>Novi...</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Uredi...</"
"guibutton> dugme je pritisnuto, <guilabel>Novi FOV Indikator</guilabel> "
"prozor je otvoren:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: config.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Field-of-View Symbol"
msgstr "Novo vidno polje simbola"

#. Tag: phrase
#: config.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "New FOV Symbol"
msgstr "Novi FOV simbol"

#. Tag: secondary
#: config.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defining New"
msgstr "Definiranje novog"

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This window lets you modify the four properties that define a FOV symbol: "
"name, size, shape, and color. The angular size for the symbol can either be "
"entered directly in the <guilabel>Field of View</guilabel> edit box, or you "
"can use the Eyepiece/Camera Tabs to calculate the field-of-view angle, given "
"parameters of your telescope/eyepiece or telescope/camera setup. The four "
"available shapes are: Circle, Square, Crosshairs, and Bullseye. Once you "
"have specified all four parameters, press <guibutton>Ok</guibutton>, and the "
"symbol will appear in the list of defined symbols. It will also be available "
"from the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>FOV Symbols</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prozor vam omogućava da modificirate četiri svojstva koja definiraju "
"simbol FOV: ime, veličinu, oblik i boju. Ugaona veličina za simbol može biti "
"ili unesena izravno u <guilabel>Vidno polje</guilabel> kutiju za uređivanje, "
"ili možete koristiti slušalice/kameru za izračunavanje ugla vidnog polja, s "
"obzirom na parametre teleskopa/okular ili podešavanja teleskop/kamera. Četri "
"dostupna oblika su: Krug, kvadrat, presjeci i centar . Kada ste odredili sva "
"četiri parametra, pritisnite<guibutton>Ok</guibutton>, i simbol će se "
"pojaviti na listi definiranih simbola. To će također biti dostupano iz "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guisubmenu>FOV Simboli</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> izbornika."
